[[14025,5466,"The rationale behind discharging Mrs Bannister from the HTT to CARS was that she had been seeing too many different people","discharging patient from HTT to CARS",""],[14026,5466,"During the inquest I was told that the deceased's husband tried to speak to members of the care team who were based at the Studdart Kennedy centre when a crisis developed","delayed access to care team",""],[14027,5466,"It took him several hours to get through. I was told there is only one phone line and that this is a known and recurring problem","single point of contact failure",""]]